1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:07,150
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

2
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:07,150
Just like the cruel angel

3
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:15,110
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

4
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:15,110
Young boy, become a legend

5
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:22,790
2D4U PRESENTS:

6
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:26,000
Aoi kaze ga ima

7
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:26,000
Even though the untested breeze...

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,800
mune no doa o tataitemo

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,800
...taps at the door to your heart

10
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:37,470
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

11
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:37,550
You just look solely at me and smile

12
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:44,730
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

13
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:44,730
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

14
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:52,070
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

15
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:52,070
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

16
00:00:52,070 --> 00:00:55,950
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

17
00:00:52,070 --> 00:00:55,950
But someday, you are sure to realize...

18
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:58,870
sono senaka ni wa

19
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:58,870
...that upon your back

20
00:00:59,530 --> 00:01:03,160
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

21
00:00:59,530 --> 00:01:03,160
You have the wings with which to fly...

22
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:06,830
no hane ga aru koto

23
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:06,960
...towards the distant future

24
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:10,960
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

25
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,960
The cruel angel's thesis

26
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:14,630
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

27
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:14,630
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

28
00:01:14,630 --> 00:01:18,470
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

29
00:01:14,630 --> 00:01:18,470
With your torrent of ardent pathos

30
00:01:18,470 --> 00:01:21,970
Omoide o uragiru nara

31
00:01:18,470 --> 00:01:21,970
If you are to betray our memories

32
00:01:21,970 --> 00:01:25,730
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

33
00:01:21,970 --> 00:01:25,730
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

34
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:29,770
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

35
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:29,770
Young boy, become a legend

36
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,310
Katsuragi, it's me.

37
00:01:35,310 --> 00:01:39,990
I've probably put you through a lot of trouble
by the time you're listening to this.

38
00:01:40,340 --> 00:01:41,830
I'm sorry.

39
00:01:41,830 --> 00:01:44,190
Tell Ritchan I said I'm sorry too.

40
00:01:44,190 --> 00:01:46,370
Also, since I've troubled you
so much anyway,

41
00:01:46,370 --> 00:01:48,520
there's this flower I've been growing...

42
00:01:48,520 --> 00:01:51,410
It'd make me happy if you'd water it for me.

43
00:01:51,410 --> 00:01:53,680
Shinji knows where it is.

44
00:01:53,680 --> 00:01:57,200
Katsuragi, the truth is with you.

45
00:01:57,200 --> 00:01:59,540
Go forward without any hesitation.

46
00:01:59,540 --> 00:02:02,590
If I ever get to see you again,

47
00:02:02,950 --> 00:02:05,680
I'll say the words I wasn't able
to say eight years ago.

48
00:02:06,080 --> 00:02:07,590
Bye.

49
00:02:10,000 --> 00:02:12,230
The phone that won't ring...

50
00:02:12,230 --> 00:02:14,190
Sorry,
but don't
bother me.
Working

51
00:02:16,030 --> 00:02:19,030
Miss Misato's still cooped up today.

52
00:02:19,030 --> 00:02:21,780
Do not enter without permission.
If you do,
I'll kill you!

53
00:02:24,260 --> 00:02:25,540
Asuka...

54
00:02:25,540 --> 00:02:27,860
I wonder if she won't be coming
back again today?

55
00:02:35,940 --> 00:02:39,710
She won't go to school and
she won't go back home.

56
00:02:39,710 --> 00:02:41,840
She just keeps playing games.

57
00:02:44,280 --> 00:02:45,430
Hikari?

58
00:02:45,430 --> 00:02:46,720
What is it?

59
00:02:46,720 --> 00:02:48,550
Wanna go to sleep?

60
00:02:48,550 --> 00:02:49,890
Okay...

61
00:03:06,800 --> 00:03:10,240
I'm sorry. Am I a bother?

62
00:03:10,240 --> 00:03:12,410
No, not at all.

63
00:03:16,060 --> 00:03:19,750
I wasn't able to win in my Eva.

64
00:03:19,750 --> 00:03:22,680
I'm not worth anything anymore.

65
00:03:22,680 --> 00:03:24,210
Not anywhere.

66
00:03:25,280 --> 00:03:29,060
I hate it. I hate it all. I hate everyone.

67
00:03:30,490 --> 00:03:33,390
But what I hate the most is myself.

68
00:03:33,830 --> 00:03:36,890
Somehow, I feel like nothing matters anymore.

69
00:03:37,500 --> 00:03:42,610
I think it's okay for you to do whatever
you want and I won't say anything,

70
00:03:42,610 --> 00:03:45,150
because I think you did your best, Asuka.

71
00:03:55,630 --> 00:03:58,890
I see, so she passed away.

72
00:03:58,890 --> 00:04:02,750
Yes, probably, even cats eventually
reach the end of their lives.

73
00:04:03,130 --> 00:04:05,440
Don't cry anymore, Grandma.

74
00:04:05,440 --> 00:04:08,810
I will. When I get some time,
I'll come home for a bit.

75
00:04:08,810 --> 00:04:11,720
I haven't visited Mother's grave
in three years either.

76
00:04:12,200 --> 00:04:14,390
I'll call you next time.

77
00:04:15,500 --> 00:04:17,680
Okay, I'm hanging up now.

78
00:04:18,330 --> 00:04:21,100
So, she died.

79
00:04:23,280 --> 00:04:25,280
EPISODE 23
TEARS

80
00:04:26,010 --> 00:04:30,410
It is impossible for us to recover
the Lance of Longinus.

81
00:04:30,410 --> 00:04:32,000
Why did you use it?

82
00:04:32,000 --> 00:04:35,870
We still do not have the planned number
of the Eva series.

83
00:04:35,870 --> 00:04:38,590
I made destroying the Angel my first priority.

84
00:04:38,590 --> 00:04:40,250
It was an unavoidable situation.

85
00:04:40,250 --> 00:04:42,130
Unavoidable, was it?

86
00:04:42,130 --> 00:04:45,300
You should make your excuses
more convincing than that.

87
00:04:45,300 --> 00:04:49,090
Your recent actions have become intolerable.

88
00:04:50,200 --> 00:04:52,800
Fuyutsuki, we're in the middle
of deliberations here.

89
00:04:54,370 --> 00:04:55,970
All right.

90
00:04:56,500 --> 00:04:58,820
An Angel is currently drawing near.

91
00:04:58,820 --> 00:05:00,570
Let us continue this at another time.

92
00:05:00,570 --> 00:05:03,600
If your seat is still waiting for you, that is.

93
00:05:04,630 --> 00:05:07,480
Ikari... Does he intend to betray Seele?

94
00:05:09,220 --> 00:05:11,160
I'll be there in fifteen minutes.

95
00:05:11,160 --> 00:05:15,200
Launch Unit 00 from Number 32.
Send Unit 02 as backup.

96
00:05:15,770 --> 00:05:18,580
That's right, Commander Ikari's orders
still stand for Unit 01.

97
00:05:18,580 --> 00:05:21,210
I don't have the authority to lift
the suspension on it.

98
00:05:21,210 --> 00:05:22,460
Bye.

99
00:05:24,610 --> 00:05:27,380
Visual confirmation of the Angel...

100
00:05:29,220 --> 00:05:32,060
Unit 00 launched, heading for intercept point.

101
00:05:32,660 --> 00:05:34,930
Unit 02 on standby at current location.

102
00:05:34,930 --> 00:05:36,440
No, launch her.

103
00:05:36,440 --> 00:05:37,520
Commander!

104
00:05:37,520 --> 00:05:40,440
It doesn't matter. She can at least
serve as a decoy.

105
00:05:40,440 --> 00:05:41,650
Yes, Sir.

106
00:05:41,650 --> 00:05:43,730
Eva Unit 02, prepare for launch.

107
00:05:44,170 --> 00:05:46,820
Here I am, shamelessly back in the pilot's seat.

108
00:05:46,820 --> 00:05:49,200
I'm so bad at letting things go.

109
00:05:49,200 --> 00:05:51,120
Unit 02, please go to Gate 8.

110
00:05:51,120 --> 00:05:53,950
Launch as soon as your deployment
position has been determined.

111
00:05:53,950 --> 00:05:57,860
I'll only be in the way, even if I go out there.

112
00:05:57,860 --> 00:06:01,290
Target approaching. It has crossed
the Gora Final Line of Defense.

113
00:06:01,290 --> 00:06:03,210
I don't care anymore.

114
00:06:11,530 --> 00:06:15,470
Target hovering over Ohwakudani,
continuing to rotate in place.

115
00:06:16,030 --> 00:06:18,430
Target's AT Field is still active.

116
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:20,350
What were you doing?

117
00:06:20,350 --> 00:06:21,860
<i>L</i> won't waste time on excuses.

118
00:06:21,860 --> 00:06:22,980
What's the situation?

119
00:06:22,980 --> 00:06:25,150
We've been in a persistent deadlock.

120
00:06:25,150 --> 00:06:28,530
Pattern cycling from blue to orange!

121
00:06:28,530 --> 00:06:29,610
What does that mean?

122
00:06:29,610 --> 00:06:31,990
Magi indicates it cannot find a solution.

123
00:06:31,990 --> 00:06:34,740
We don't have enough data
to come to an answer.

124
00:06:34,740 --> 00:06:38,210
But one thing's certain.
That shape isn't a fixed form.

125
00:06:38,210 --> 00:06:40,670
So we can't make the first move.

126
00:06:41,140 --> 00:06:43,630
Rei, we're going to wait and watch for a while.

127
00:06:43,630 --> 00:06:45,040
No, it's coming.

128
00:06:48,980 --> 00:06:50,510
Rei, counter it!

129
00:06:50,510 --> 00:06:52,800
It's no use! She won't make it in time!

130
00:06:59,660 --> 00:07:02,650
Target is in physical contact with Unit 00!

131
00:07:02,650 --> 00:07:04,610
How is Unit 00's AT Field?!

132
00:07:04,610 --> 00:07:07,740
Operational, but the Angel is eroding it!

133
00:07:07,740 --> 00:07:11,200
The Angel is aggressively seeking
to make first contact?

134
00:07:11,200 --> 00:07:12,690
With Unit 00?

135
00:07:20,810 --> 00:07:22,120
Danger!

136
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:24,670
It's invading Unit 00's organic pans!

137
00:07:24,670 --> 00:07:26,260
Launch Eva Unit 02!

138
00:07:26,260 --> 00:07:28,760
Send her to rescue and back up Rei!

139
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:34,550
Target making further inroads!

140
00:07:34,550 --> 00:07:35,760
This is dangerous.

141
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:38,920
Over five percent has been
biologically fused already.

142
00:07:43,910 --> 00:07:47,440
Asuka, close your distance by 300,
deploy your AT Field at maximum,

143
00:07:47,440 --> 00:07:49,650
and fire the Palette Gun into the target's rear!

144
00:07:49,650 --> 00:07:52,650
Got it? Eva Unit 02, lift off!

145
00:07:54,300 --> 00:07:57,830
Move out, Asuka. What's the matter?
What's wrong with Unit 02?!

146
00:07:57,830 --> 00:08:00,250
It's no good! The synch rate
is in the single digits!

147
00:08:00,250 --> 00:08:01,240
Asuka!

148
00:08:02,930 --> 00:08:06,040
It won't move. It just won't move!

149
00:08:06,600 --> 00:08:08,590
She'll only be a sitting duck out there!

150
00:08:08,590 --> 00:08:10,540
Bring her back! Quickly!

151
00:08:20,620 --> 00:08:21,600
Who's there?

152
00:08:21,600 --> 00:08:23,020
Me?

153
00:08:23,020 --> 00:08:25,230
The me inside the Eva.

154
00:08:25,710 --> 00:08:28,570
No, I can sense that there's
someone other than me.

155
00:08:28,920 --> 00:08:30,070
Who are you?

156
00:08:30,320 --> 00:08:33,850
An Angel? The person that we call an Angel?

157
00:08:34,630 --> 00:08:36,570
Won't you become one with me?

158
00:08:36,570 --> 00:08:40,320
No. I am me. I am not you.

159
00:08:40,930 --> 00:08:44,780
I see, but it's no use. It's too late now.

160
00:08:46,980 --> 00:08:50,150
I'll share what's in my heart with you.

161
00:08:50,150 --> 00:08:53,540
I'll share this feeling with you.

162
00:08:54,480 --> 00:08:59,300
Doesn't it hurt? See?
Doesn't your heart ache?

163
00:08:59,300 --> 00:09:02,220
Hun? No, you're wrong. It's...

164
00:09:03,490 --> 00:09:04,850
...loneliness?

165
00:09:04,850 --> 00:09:07,140
Yes, it's loneliness, isn't it?

166
00:09:07,140 --> 00:09:10,480
Loneliness? I don't understand.

167
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:12,730
You hate being alone, don't you?

168
00:09:13,250 --> 00:09:17,910
There are so many of us, and yet,
you hate being alone.

169
00:09:17,910 --> 00:09:20,540
That is what loneliness is.

170
00:09:20,540 --> 00:09:23,220
That is what is inside your heart.

171
00:09:23,220 --> 00:09:27,320
That is your own heart, overflowing with sorrow.

172
00:09:29,810 --> 00:09:31,880
These are tears?

173
00:09:32,130 --> 00:09:34,500
The one crying is me?

174
00:09:36,340 --> 00:09:37,220
Rei!

175
00:09:37,220 --> 00:09:40,890
The suspension on Unit 01
has been lifted as of now.

176
00:09:40,890 --> 00:09:42,640
Send him out immediately.

177
00:09:42,990 --> 00:09:44,850
Send him out.

178
00:09:44,850 --> 00:09:46,220
Yes, Sir.

179
00:09:47,910 --> 00:09:51,820
What? You didn't send him out for me.

180
00:10:02,680 --> 00:10:05,620
Deploy your AT Field. Rescue Rei immediately.

181
00:10:05,620 --> 00:10:07,160
Okay!

182
00:10:08,170 --> 00:10:09,830
Ikari?

183
00:10:13,400 --> 00:10:17,540
This is my heart wanting to
become one with Ikari?

184
00:10:19,440 --> 00:10:20,710
No.

185
00:10:21,490 --> 00:10:23,060
The AT Field has been reversed!

186
00:10:23,060 --> 00:10:24,600
It will be eroded away at once!

187
00:10:24,600 --> 00:10:25,980
Does she intend to contain the Angel?!

188
00:10:26,230 --> 00:10:28,640
Rei, abandon the Eva and get out of there!

189
00:10:29,000 --> 00:10:30,150
No.

190
00:10:30,150 --> 00:10:33,800
If I go, the AT Field will disappear.

191
00:10:33,800 --> 00:10:35,680
So, I can't.

192
00:10:38,250 --> 00:10:39,920
Rei, do you mean to die?

193
00:10:39,920 --> 00:10:42,870
The core is collapsing!
Critical point exceeded!

194
00:11:10,580 --> 00:11:12,940
Target has been destroyed.

195
00:11:13,790 --> 00:11:17,100
At this time, this operation is officially over.

196
00:11:17,100 --> 00:11:19,820
Change our status to Class One Alert.

197
00:11:19,820 --> 00:11:22,820
Roger that. Switching immediately
to Condition Yellow.

198
00:11:22,820 --> 00:11:23,990
What about Unit 00's status?

199
00:11:23,990 --> 00:11:27,040
Ejection of the entry plug
has not been confirmed.

200
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:29,620
Hurry the rescue operation for the survivor.

201
00:11:29,620 --> 00:11:31,320
If there is one, that is.

202
00:11:47,510 --> 00:11:50,350
No antibiotic substance from the 16th Angel
has been found thus far.

203
00:11:50,350 --> 00:11:52,390
We will continue searching.

204
00:11:50,810 --> 00:11:54,440
Level C traces are spreading towards the southwest.

205
00:11:53,310 --> 00:11:54,970
Dr. Akagi!

206
00:11:56,120 --> 00:11:58,360
What happened here will be
classified top secret.

207
00:11:58,360 --> 00:12:01,650
Take back the plug. Dispose of everything else.

208
00:12:01,650 --> 00:12:02,490
Roger that.

209
00:12:02,490 --> 00:12:04,690
Let's get to work! Quickly!

210
00:12:05,660 --> 00:12:05,910
{THE 3RD ANGEL

211
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:06,410
{SACHIEL

212
00:12:06,160 --> 00:12:09,500
At last, we have defeated up through
the 16th Angel.

213
00:12:06,410 --> 00:12:06,660
{THE 4TH ANGEL

214
00:12:06,950 --> 00:12:07,200
{SHAMSHIEL

215
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:07,450
{THE 5TH ANGEL

216
00:12:07,660 --> 00:12:07,910
{RAMIEL

217
00:12:07,910 --> 00:12:08,160
{THE 6TH ANGEL

218
00:12:08,410 --> 00:12:08,660
{GAGHIEL

219
00:12:08,660 --> 00:12:08,910
{THE 7TH ANGEL

220
00:12:09,160 --> 00:12:09,410
{ISRAFEL

221
00:12:09,410 --> 00:12:09,660
{THE 8TH ANGEL

222
00:12:09,500 --> 00:12:14,170
That leaves only one Angel described
in Seele's Dead Sea Scrolls.

223
00:12:09,910 --> 00:12:10,160
{SANDALPHON

224
00:12:10,160 --> 00:12:10,410
{THE 9TH ANGEL

225
00:12:10,660 --> 00:12:10,910
{MATRIEL

226
00:12:10,910 --> 00:12:11,160
{THE 10TH ANGEL

227
00:12:11,410 --> 00:12:11,660
{SAHAQIEL

228
00:12:11,660 --> 00:12:11,910
{THE 11TH ANGEL

229
00:12:12,160 --> 00:12:12,410
{YROUEL

230
00:12:12,410 --> 00:12:12,670
{THE 12TH ANGEL

231
00:12:12,920 --> 00:12:13,170
{LELIEL

232
00:12:13,170 --> 00:12:13,420
{THE 13TH ANGEL

233
00:12:13,670 --> 00:12:13,920
{BARADIEL

234
00:12:13,920 --> 00:12:14,170
{THE 14TH ANGEL

235
00:12:14,170 --> 00:12:16,460
The promised time is near.

236
00:12:14,420 --> 00:12:14,670
{ZERUEL

237
00:12:14,670 --> 00:12:14,920
{THE 15TH ANGEL

238
00:12:15,170 --> 00:12:15,420
{ARIEL

239
00:12:15,420 --> 00:12:15,670
{THE 16TH ANGEL

240
00:12:15,920 --> 00:12:16,170
{ARMISAEL

241
00:12:16,460 --> 00:12:20,460
Our journey has been long and the
sacrifices have been great.

242
00:12:20,460 --> 00:12:23,220
Indeed, first, the Lance of Longinus,

243
00:12:23,220 --> 00:12:25,340
and now, the loss of Unit 00.

244
00:12:25,340 --> 00:12:28,510
We have more than enough reasons
to relieve Ikari of his command.

245
00:12:28,510 --> 00:12:30,600
That man is smart enough
to know the significance

246
00:12:30,600 --> 00:12:32,520
of why we allowed Fuyutsuki to return safely.

247
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:36,440
We need another human sacrifice
to counter Ikari.

248
00:12:36,440 --> 00:12:39,150
And we need someone who knows the truth.

249
00:13:01,360 --> 00:13:04,040
Shinji, I'm coming in.

250
00:13:11,620 --> 00:13:15,260
Miss Misato, the tears won't come.

251
00:13:15,790 --> 00:13:19,810
I feel sad, but the tears just won't come.

252
00:13:20,250 --> 00:13:26,560
Shinji, this is about all I can
do for you right now.

253
00:13:27,130 --> 00:13:28,910
Stop it!

254
00:13:28,910 --> 00:13:30,650
Stop it, Miss Misato.

255
00:13:31,300 --> 00:13:33,110
I'm sorry.

256
00:13:37,600 --> 00:13:39,680
But he must be feeling lonely.

257
00:13:39,680 --> 00:13:42,130
Is he afraid of women?

258
00:13:42,130 --> 00:13:44,880
No, he's afraid of being intimate with people.

259
00:13:46,150 --> 00:13:48,420
Pen Pen, come here.

260
00:13:52,350 --> 00:13:55,050
I see, it doesn't matter who.

261
00:13:55,050 --> 00:13:57,230
I am the one who is lonely.

262
00:14:07,340 --> 00:14:09,310
Yes, hello?

263
00:14:09,840 --> 00:14:11,450
What did you say?!

264
00:14:11,450 --> 00:14:12,580
Shinji!

265
00:14:12,580 --> 00:14:14,540
<i><i>Dr. Godai of Internal Medicine 1, Dr. Godai.</i></i>

266
00:14:15,660 --> 00:14:18,120
<i><i>Please contact Conference Room 2 immediately.</i></i>

267
00:14:18,960 --> 00:14:20,210
Ayanami!

268
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:23,250
Neurosurgery 1

269
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:23,250
Surgery 3

270
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:23,250
2nd Floor Ward

271
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:23,250
Diagnostic Radiology

272
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:23,250
X-ray Information Desk

273
00:14:25,090 --> 00:14:27,720
I'm so glad you're okay.

274
00:14:28,820 --> 00:14:31,390
I guess my dad's not here.

275
00:14:32,720 --> 00:14:35,020
Thank you for saving me.

276
00:14:35,020 --> 00:14:36,480
What do you mean?

277
00:14:36,480 --> 00:14:41,400
What do I mean? You sacrificed
Unit 00 to save me.

278
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:44,020
I see, so I saved you.

279
00:14:44,020 --> 00:14:46,320
Yeah, you don't remember?

280
00:14:46,320 --> 00:14:48,150
No, I just don't know.

281
00:14:48,400 --> 00:14:51,620
Because I think I'm probably the third one.

282
00:14:53,930 --> 00:14:55,990
Ayanami

283
00:15:23,250 --> 00:15:25,230
These are tears?

284
00:15:25,230 --> 00:15:26,860
This should be the first time I've seen them,

285
00:15:26,860 --> 00:15:29,100
but I feel like this isn't the first time.

286
00:15:29,670 --> 00:15:31,530
Am I crying?

287
00:15:32,420 --> 00:15:35,290
Why am I crying?

288
00:15:35,290 --> 00:15:38,830
That's right. The First Child will be
maintained in her current condition.

289
00:15:38,830 --> 00:15:41,040
There is no need for new restrictions.

290
00:15:41,040 --> 00:15:43,500
The same goes for the Second and the Third.

291
00:15:43,500 --> 00:15:45,290
They only need to be watched.

292
00:15:45,290 --> 00:15:50,130
But Chairman Kiel and the rest will raise
a fuss when they learn that Rei is alive.

293
00:15:50,130 --> 00:15:53,590
I have offered something else
to Seele's old men.

294
00:15:53,590 --> 00:15:55,210
We needn't worry.

295
00:15:56,390 --> 00:15:59,430
We would like for things to proceed smoothly.

296
00:15:59,430 --> 00:16:03,980
We do not wish to subject you to
any more degradation and suffering.

297
00:16:03,980 --> 00:16:06,520
I do not feel humiliated whatsoever.

298
00:16:06,520 --> 00:16:08,650
A strong-willed woman.

299
00:16:08,650 --> 00:16:11,280
I can understand why Ikari
would want you by his side.

300
00:16:11,280 --> 00:16:16,990
But the person who handed you to us
is none other than Ikari.

301
00:16:17,240 --> 00:16:19,910
He refused to hand over the pilot
of Unit 00 for questioning.

302
00:16:19,910 --> 00:16:23,210
He sent you as a substitute, Dr. Akagi.

303
00:16:23,850 --> 00:16:26,460
I was sent in place of Rei?

304
00:16:26,710 --> 00:16:28,340
Sorry,
but don't
bother me.
Working

305
00:16:28,730 --> 00:16:31,460
This is a part of the truth that you wanted.

306
00:16:31,760 --> 00:16:35,050
I devised thirty-six other ways
to send it to you,

307
00:16:35,050 --> 00:16:36,680
but you probably won't get them.

308
00:16:36,680 --> 00:16:38,760
The only definite one is this capsule.

309
00:16:39,490 --> 00:16:41,350
This is everything I have to offer.

310
00:16:41,350 --> 00:16:43,300
Do with it as you see fit.

311
00:16:43,300 --> 00:16:46,890
The password is our very first
memory together.

312
00:16:47,460 --> 00:16:49,560
Bye, take care.

313
00:16:50,880 --> 00:16:54,900
The phone that won't ring,
I won't let it irritate me anymore.

314
00:16:56,950 --> 00:16:59,870
Because I've accepted your feelings.

315
00:17:03,620 --> 00:17:06,710
Are we certain we did the right thing
concerning Dr. Akagi?

316
00:17:06,710 --> 00:17:08,420
She is different from Fuyutsuki.

317
00:17:08,420 --> 00:17:10,670
Returning her is in our best interest.

318
00:17:10,670 --> 00:17:12,920
She has rendered distinguishing service
to the Eva series.

319
00:17:12,920 --> 00:17:15,050
She can be of some use to us right now.

320
00:17:15,050 --> 00:17:18,350
Indeed, for the sake of mankind's future.

321
00:17:18,350 --> 00:17:22,060
Eight Evangelions are already being prepared.

322
00:17:22,060 --> 00:17:24,730
Which leaves four more.

323
00:17:24,730 --> 00:17:29,790
The annihilation of New Tokyo-S will be good
material upon which to advance our plans.

324
00:17:29,790 --> 00:17:31,400
Hurry their completion.

325
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:33,860
That will be our promised day.

326
00:17:38,090 --> 00:17:39,830
Yes, hello?

327
00:17:40,180 --> 00:17:41,830
Just listen to me.

328
00:17:41,830 --> 00:17:43,620
I've released the restraints placed on you.

329
00:17:43,620 --> 00:17:45,540
You should be able to go outside now.

330
00:17:45,540 --> 00:17:46,990
Miss Ritsuko?

331
00:17:58,440 --> 00:18:00,960
It's no use, not without my pass.

332
00:18:01,470 --> 00:18:04,310
I see. It's Kaji's handiwork, isn't it?

333
00:18:04,310 --> 00:18:07,190
You're going to let me see the secret
in there with my own eyes.

334
00:18:07,350 --> 00:18:09,980
Fine, but he's coming too.

335
00:18:12,580 --> 00:18:13,690
Fine.

336
00:18:32,350 --> 00:18:34,670
This looks just like Ayanami's room.

337
00:18:34,670 --> 00:18:36,550
This IS Rei Ayanami's room.

338
00:18:36,550 --> 00:18:38,550
This is where she was born and raised.

339
00:18:38,550 --> 00:18:39,550
This place?

340
00:18:39,550 --> 00:18:41,780
Yes, this is where she was born.

341
00:18:41,780 --> 00:18:44,770
The water and light that form
Rei's subconscious

342
00:18:44,770 --> 00:18:46,930
must have a strong impression of this place.

343
00:18:46,930 --> 00:18:51,020
Dr. Akagi, this isn't what I came here to see.

344
00:18:51,020 --> 00:18:53,270
I know, Misato.

345
00:18:56,420 --> 00:18:57,690
Evas?!

346
00:18:57,690 --> 00:18:59,150
The very first ones.

347
00:18:59,150 --> 00:19:00,490
They are the failures.

348
00:19:00,490 --> 00:19:02,440
They were scrapped ten years ago.

349
00:19:02,800 --> 00:19:04,580
A graveyard for Evas...

350
00:19:04,580 --> 00:19:06,540
It's just a garbage dump.

351
00:19:06,540 --> 00:19:09,110
This is also where your mother disappeared.

352
00:19:09,430 --> 00:19:13,670
You may not remember it, but I believe
you were also watching

353
00:19:13,670 --> 00:19:16,090
the very moment your mother vanished.

354
00:19:18,470 --> 00:19:19,790
Ritsuko!

355
00:19:27,280 --> 00:19:30,310
So, this is the source of the dummy plugs?

356
00:19:30,310 --> 00:19:32,190
I will show you the truth.

357
00:19:39,000 --> 00:19:40,600
Rei Ayanami?

358
00:19:42,420 --> 00:19:45,240
You're not saying the Evas' dummy plugs are...

359
00:19:45,240 --> 00:19:48,200
That's right, the part that becomes
the core of the dummy system,

360
00:19:48,200 --> 00:19:49,870
and this is the manufacturing plant for it.

361
00:19:49,870 --> 00:19:51,210
This is?!

362
00:19:51,210 --> 00:19:52,960
These are just dummies.

363
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:55,620
And nothing more than pans for Rei.

364
00:19:56,060 --> 00:19:59,840
Man found God and in their joy,
tried to make Him theirs.

365
00:19:59,840 --> 00:20:01,630
That's why there was divine retribution.

366
00:20:01,630 --> 00:20:03,550
That was fifteen years ago.

367
00:20:03,550 --> 00:20:06,340
The God they found had also
disappeared by then.

368
00:20:06,340 --> 00:20:10,150
But then, they tried to resurrect
God on their own.

369
00:20:10,150 --> 00:20:11,600
The result was Adam.

370
00:20:11,850 --> 00:20:15,190
And imitating God, they created
people from Adam.

371
00:20:15,190 --> 00:20:16,730
The result was the Evas.

372
00:20:16,730 --> 00:20:19,690
People? They're human?

373
00:20:19,690 --> 00:20:22,030
Yes, they're human.

374
00:20:22,030 --> 00:20:23,660
The Evas do not intrinsically have souls,

375
00:20:23,660 --> 00:20:26,040
but they have human souls embedded in them.

376
00:20:26,040 --> 00:20:28,230
They were all salvaged.

377
00:20:28,550 --> 00:20:31,910
The only vessel that contained a soul was Rei.

378
00:20:31,910 --> 00:20:34,740
She was the only one born with a soul.

379
00:20:34,740 --> 00:20:37,250
The Chamber of Gaf was empty, you see.

380
00:20:37,250 --> 00:20:40,550
These things here that look like Rei
have no souls.

381
00:20:40,550 --> 00:20:42,190
They're just vessels.

382
00:20:42,190 --> 00:20:44,800
That's why I'm going to destroy them.
Because I hate them.

383
00:20:53,200 --> 00:20:55,970
Do you know just what you're doing?!

384
00:20:57,210 --> 00:21:00,280
Yes, I know. I'm destroying them.

385
00:21:00,280 --> 00:21:03,650
They're not people.
They're things shaped like people.

386
00:21:04,050 --> 00:21:08,030
But I lost, even to these things! I couldn't win!

387
00:21:08,030 --> 00:21:10,160
I only needed to think of him,

388
00:21:10,160 --> 00:21:13,090
and I could endure any kind of humiliation!

389
00:21:13,090 --> 00:21:15,630
I didn't care what happened to my body!

390
00:21:15,630 --> 00:21:19,490
But he... He...

391
00:21:20,060 --> 00:21:21,790
And I knew too.

392
00:21:22,210 --> 00:21:24,500
I'm a fool!

393
00:21:24,940 --> 00:21:27,880
Like mother, like daughter,
we're both big fools!

394
00:21:30,030 --> 00:21:32,720
If you want to kill me, do it.

395
00:21:32,720 --> 00:21:35,470
No, I would be happy if you would do it.

396
00:21:36,120 --> 00:21:39,010
That would be truly foolish of you.

397
00:21:48,340 --> 00:21:51,610
The tragedy of the people
possessed by the Evas...

398
00:21:56,210 --> 00:21:58,210
But that goes for me too.

399
00:21:58,250 --> 00:22:00,630
TO BE CONTINUED

400
00:23:06,070 --> 00:23:06,900
PREVIEW

401
00:23:06,820 --> 00:23:08,490
The city disappears, his friends leave.

402
00:23:08,490 --> 00:23:10,950
A boy smiles upon the timid Shinji.

403
00:23:10,950 --> 00:23:14,330
Shinji gives himself over to the smile
that is like a soothing breeze.

404
00:23:14,330 --> 00:23:17,700
But a cruel fate was in store for them.

405
00:23:17,700 --> 00:23:19,710
Next time: "The Final Messenger"

406
00:23:18,710 --> 00:23:21,080
The Final Messenger
